      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This product focus considers the characteristics and application of Atrauman, a non-adherent dressing, in relation to the different aspects of wound healing. Atrauman has many characteristics that make it an ideal dressing choice in a number of clinical scenarios, including: pain free removal; promotion of healthy granulation tissue; cost effectiveness and versatility."},
